      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our founder",
        "heading": "Built by a doctor\nwho wanted proof.",
        "text": "<p>Richie Barclay is a cell biologist with a PhD in cellular biology and nutrition, a Harley Street nutritionist for the last 13 years, and a former cricketer.</p><p>He started MUTO after years of watching supplements sell on claims nobody had checked, with the doses hidden in blends. So MUTO does it the other way: every dose is on the label, every batch goes to an outside lab, and six doctors and scientists review the formula.</p>",
        "quote": "I built MUTO because I was tired of supplements that ask you to take them on trust.",
        "quote_by": "Dr Richie Barclay, PhD, founder",
        "link_label": "Got a question? Email Richie",
        "link": "mailto:hello@mutolongevity.com",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-founder.jpg",
        "image_fallback": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/about-founder.jpg?v=1790751995",
